                        "review": "The developer made the effort to add Steam Trading Cards, but couldn’t be bothered to add any Steam achievements. With 80 levels across four different worlds, there were plenty of opportunities for achievements, whether for completing levels, solving difficult puzzles, or finishing the different worlds. The game is a decent little puzzle experience, but the lack of achievements is a disappointing omission for anyone who likes having something to work toward and collect on Steam.",
